==English==

===Etymology===
From {{term|endo-}} + {{etyl|grc}} {{term|κρίνειν||to separate|tr=krinein|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈɛnd.oʊ.krɪn/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Producing internal secretions that are transported around the body by the bloodstream.
# Pertaining to the [[endocrine gland]]s or their secretions.

